        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Matt Groening, Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, Rich Moore, Hank Azaria\n- Works: The Telltale Head\n- Characters: Apu Nahasapeemapetilon\n- Roles: writer, director, voice actor, cartoonist, producer, animator\n\nFacts:\n- Matt Groening was born on February 15, 1954.\n- Matt Groening is an American cartoonist, writer, producer, animator, and voice actor.\n- The episode \"The Telltale Head\" was written by Al Jean, Mike Reiss, Sam Simon, and Matt Groening.\n- The episode \"The Telltale Head\" was directed by Rich Moore.\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon is voiced by Hank Azaria.\n- Apu Nahasapeemapetilon first appeared in the episode \"The Telltale Head\".",
